# Notification Rules

- Notifications are secondary effects; the database state is authoritative.
- Define notification events from delivery state/offer/payment events.
- Support push notifications for mobile clients and real-time events when connected.
- Do not make a delivery state transition depend on notification delivery success.
- Prevent duplicate notifications when an event is retried.
- Do not include unnecessary sensitive data in notification payloads.
- Keep provider integration replaceable.
